The '''Middle Town''' is a home base point in the middle of the [[First Sea]].

==Usage==
The Middle Town is home to many shops and [[NPCs]], one of which serves quest significance ([[The Son Quest]] for the Dark Blade V2 and also the route to the [[Second Sea]] by speaking to the [[Experienced Captain]] after defeating the [[Ice Admiral]]), although some include NPCs that sell [[Swords]] and [[Guns]], as well as the user VegaVoss.

==Appearance==
The Middle Town is mostly devoid of grass, save for a few areas around the island. In the very center, there are two buildings and a courtyard which is surrounded by 13 buildings and has a fountain in the middle of the squares. On the left and right edges of the island, there are stone docks, and on the top and bottom edges, there are rocky beaches.
==Port==
The port of Middle Town consists of three docks on the eastern and western ends of the island for a total of six docks. Up to six ships may be spawned at a time at Middle Town. Middle Town has the largest port in First Sea.

==Developer House==
[[File:Middle Town The Son Quest Update 30.png|thumb|179x179px|The house where [[Robotmega]] and the [[Aura Editor]] are located.]]
The Middle Town is also home to [[Robotmega]], an [[NPCs|NPC]] located in a house with a red roof that starts [[The Son Quest]] for the [[Dark Blade]] V2. This building also has inside the [[Aura Editor]], who allows the player to change the stage of their [[Aura]]. 

== Tester Dorm ==
Middle Town has this house at the back of the [[Blox Fruit Gacha|Blox Fruits Gacha]] and in front of the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]] where you can break the glass at the second floor of the house. There resides [[Janus]], a Blox Fruits Tester, he will have a chance of spawn every day starting at UTC 0:00 on every 30-minute interval, as the day goes on the chance will get higher and higher. Once he has spawned for the day you must wait until the next day starting a UTC 0:00 to see him again. His spawn is global so server hopping will not work. The tester, [[Janus]], will come out of their room he will stay in his spot for 30 minutes then leave.

