== [[Island Secrets]] ==

* Break the window above the broken cart next to [[Experienced Captain]] and go inside. He will have a chance of spawn every day starting at UTC 0:00 on every 30 minute interval, as the day goes on the chance will get higher and higher. Once he has spawned for the day you must wait until the next day starting a UTC 0:00 to see him again. His spawn is global so server hopping will not work.  The developer, [[Janus]], will come out of their room he will stay in his spot for 30 minutes then leave. Talk with him and then go to the [[Robotmega]] building. Grab the key next to the [[Aura Editor]]. Go around to the back of the same building and unlock the door. Once unlocked, a cutscene will play showing the player hacking into a computer to steal a special system. Finally, go back to [[Janus]] and interact with him. He will reward the player with the Tester role.

* Talk with the [[Experienced Captain]] [[NPCs|NPC]] and click the option that talks about his duty. After that, there's a chance that a "Count The Flags" mini game will start. After completing 4 rounds, he'll reward you. If you fail the minigame you can re-do it.
* The player must go around Middle Town using melee M1s on trees, barrels, lamps, or boxes. When hit, the object the map is hidden in will start to shake. Once dropped, the map will lead the player across Middle Town to collect more map pieces, until the entire map is put together. The final map piece will reveal the location of the buried treasure. Dig it up by hitting it with melee M1s and 2-4 skeletons will spawn in, which the player must defeat in order to complete the quest and speak to the [[Experienced Captain]].

==[[Bosses]]==
[[The Saw]] will spawn in the Middle Town near the fountain every 1 hour and 15 minutes while the following [[System Messages|message]] is shown in chat:<br>{{System Message|The Saw has spawned in the game! You have 15 minutes to defeat him and possibly get a rare reward!}}

Once defeated, [[The Saw]] has a small chance to drop the [[Shark Saw]], as well as a moderate sum of {{EXP}} and {{Money|Money}}.

==Trivia==
* No other buildings in the game use domed architecture, making the two domed buildings at the Middle Town the only examples of it in the game.
* Middle Town is a significant island due to the fact that it is an island where a lot of important [[NPCs]] usually appear, some of them even being event-exclusive.
* As of [[Updates/29.0|Update 29.0]], there is no house in front of [[Blox Fruit Dealer]] since the removal of [[Fish Fights]] arenas. 
* Before there was another building that was replaced by the fish battles. Now the fish battles are gone, and the building was never added again.

